This is the Rust port of the AlgoVoi RFC 9421 verifier core (Ed25519, trust
boundary public-key gate, RFC 9421 Section 2.5 signing base, Signature-Input /
Signature parsing, RFC 9530 Content-Digest, and signature freshness). It is a
faithful reimplementation of the reference Python and TypeScript
algovoi-rfc9421-verifier packages and reproduces the frozen reference vectors
byte for byte.

